刷工艺、材质选择、制作质量，解决落地问题。\n3.跨部门协作与项目管理\n• 与营销、运营、产品团队紧密配合，承接需求并转化为高质量设计方案。\n• 管理设计排期，把控项目进度与质量，按时交付；归档设计源文件，维护资产库。\n• 收集市场与用户反馈，持续优化设计，提升视觉效果与商业价值。","Require":"1. 基础资质\n• 本科及以上学历，视觉传达、平面设计、品牌设计、艺术设计等相关专业。\n• 2-5年品牌设计/视觉设计经验，有品牌全案落地经验，乙方设计公司/广告公司背景优先。\n• 具备欧美留学/生活背景优先；\n2. 专业技能\n• 精通Adobe全家桶：Photoshop、Illustrator、InDesign；熟悉Figma/Sketch协作工具。\n• 熟悉CMYK/RGB色彩管理、印刷工艺、材质特性，能独立对接制作方。\n3. 能力素质\n• 具备品牌思维与商业意识，理解设计背后的策略与目标，不只追求“好看”。\n• 创意活跃，对欧美设计趋势、流行文化敏感，能独立出概念并推动落地。\n• 优秀的沟通表达、逻辑思维，强执行力、抗压性、多任务管理能力，能快速响应需求并保障质量。\n4. 加分项\n• 有快消、美妆、服装、奢侈品等行业设计经验。\n• 有联名设计、IP跨界、线下空间视觉\n• 掌握C4D/3D建模渲染、AE动效、AI绘图工具。\n• 热爱美甲，熟悉欧美美妆，美甲行业趋势，具备美甲DIY实操经验；","ClassificationOne":"设计类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-21T10:22:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6fe81d90-2e